@title Klonoa - Empire of Dreams (USA)
@file Klonoa - Empire of Dreams (U) [!].gba
@game AKLE
@chip EEPROM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba

# New Game in file A (the game writes the file to EEPROM when it is created
# and again on entering Vision 1-1), skip the intro, world map, Ghazzaland
# story, Vision 1-1: grab a Moo, take a hit, jump up the ledges, pause,
# Select Vision back to the map. [load]: Continue, file A shows
# World 1 Ghazzaland, YES resumes on the Ghazzaland vision map.
# Findings: entering Vision 1-1 the game writes 15 EEPROM blocks, each
# polled to ready; dingbat's block time (GBATEK's ~108368 cycles) brings the
# title card and the level two frames before mgba (~115000 a block) and the
# second reference: with -d:EEPROM_SETTLE_CYCLES=115005 all three are
# pixel-identical at f3320 and f3500. The cart's own time is unmeasured
# (r0table row eesettle4k). In the level the three drift by a frame here and
# there and re-converge
# (identical at f4153). nba does not read back its own 8 KB battery file:
# its title has no Continue on [load] (f1046).
# new_game is compare=none: the title menu's clouds are darkened (BLDY 5)
# and dingbat is one 5-bit step darker than mgba on ~30k px -- the darken
# rounding the SP's blendprobe photographs gave, not a scroll difference
# (same cloud position); the second reference's clouds sit elsewhere
# (14367 px from mgba).
# The OCR of the copyright line flips (docs/playtest-bugs.md, "Klonoa: the
# clouds are the darken rounding, the Vision 1-1 card is the cart's EEPROM").
[new]
wait 600
wait 200
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 120
checkpoint new_game window=30 compare=none
press A
wait 180
checkpoint save_file window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 180
press A
wait 240
press START
wait 240
checkpoint world_map window=30
press A
wait 180
press A
wait 180
checkpoint story window=30
press START
wait 240
checkpoint vision_map window=30
press A
wait 240
checkpoint tutorial window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 60
wait 180
wait 180
checkpoint level_start window=30
press B
wait 40
press RIGHT hold=90
press RIGHT hold=120
hold RIGHT
press A hold=20
wait 40
press A hold=20
wait 60
release
press B
wait 30
hold RIGHT
press A hold=25
wait 60
release
wait 30
press B
wait 40
checkpoint holding_moo window=30
press START
wait 30
checkpoint pause window=30 compare=text
press DOWN after=10
press DOWN after=10
press A
wait 60
wait 240
checkpoint back_to_map window=30

[load]
wait 860
press START
wait 180
checkpoint continue_menu window=30 compare=text
press DOWN after=10
press A
wait 180
checkpoint save_file window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 240
press A
wait 300
checkpoint resumed_map window=30
